      statement: "RESTATED 2026-10-25 as a measurable matrix. For each FEATURE row and each LANGUAGE column whose grammar has the construct, a fixture containing the construct populates the feature. ROWS: (1) cyclomatic_complexity counts every decision construct, including ternary and statement-modifier forms; (2) signature populated for a callable with a body; (3) code outside any function anchors its calls on the file or class node; (4) extends/implements to an EXTERNAL base emits an unresolved typed edge; (5) constructing an EXTERNAL class emits an instantiates edge. COLUMNS: python, javascript, typescript, java, kotlin, scala, csharp, go, rust, swift, php, ruby, c, cpp, lua, elixir. THRESHOLD: violated while any cell is a gap; open cells are listed in the discussion. Bodyless declarations (protocol/trait methods) are exempt from rows 1-2."  # 28c6
